## 2. Proposed architecture

```
tender.pdf (202p) --pdftotext -layout--> pages.jsonl (physical page map)
pages.jsonl --> step1_section.py (header-regex anchor + LLM confirm) --> sections.json
sections.json --> step2_split.py (pypdf) --> output/sections/tender_NN.pdf
             --> step3_extract.py (N parallel extractors + 2-tier comparator)
                 --> pos_NN.csv (+pos_NN.verify.json, +pos_NN.rejected.csv)
             --> step4_merge.py --> tender_lv_positions.csv (raw, LV%04d)
             --> step5_match.py --> csv rewrite (suggested_product_id/match fields)
                 + tender_lv_output.json + pipeline_report.json
--> _2_Calculator step1-4 --> calc.json --> web_ui
```

### Directory layout

Superseded by the authoritative tree in `## Round 3` R3.2 (same scripts; R3 adds
settings.yaml/env/flag details and the exact output/ artifact inventory). Env redirect per
tender (mirrors `AUTOTENDER_CALC_OUT`): `AUTOTENDER_TENDER_PDF`, `AUTOTENDER_OUT_DIR`.

