Exact field lists + types are normative in `## Round 3` R3.4. Summary: `pages.jsonl` =
`{"page":N,"text":"…"}` per physical page (`pdftotext -f N -l N -layout`, zero deps);
`sections.json` = todo-1 schema + `system/kind` extras + `meta{pdf_sha256,…}`, coverage
validator enforces sorted/contiguous full cover of `1..page_count`; `pos_NN.csv` = golden
columns minus match ones plus `local_id` (`S03-012`, collision-free in parallel), `system,
technical_attributes, raw_source_snippet, block_letter, block_index` (`position_code`
dropped — none exist); `pos_NN.verify.json` per row; final csv = golden 12 exactly
