## 6. Error handling & review flags

Final taxonomy in `## Round 3` R3.7. Principles: retries only in `llm_client.py`
(Retry-After-min + jitter, 3 tries / 120 s cap, 429/5xx only); JSON repair = fence strip +
one re-ask; sectioning = regex anchor + LLM confirm + coverage validator; extraction =
two-tier comparator, rejected rows side-filed + one repair round; matching = gray zone →
`review_required`, no-match → explicit non-`calculated` status; traceability = `pdf_sha256`
per artifact, `source_page`+snippet per row, `pipeline_report.json` per run.

