## 8. Risks

**Catalog coverage**: 56 fictional Demo* products vs a real tender — most positions
unmatched; statuses stay honest, review UI consumes flagged rows. **Cross-lingual gap**:
German tender vs English catalog; without embeddings, dims + category carry the weight.
**Table structure**: Pos. column empty, quantities inline; block segmentation is the hard
part. **Non-contiguous systems** (244.03) and **LA-less headers** (244.04/244.06) break
naive regexes — covered in step1 (proven R3.1). **Page offsets**: footers restart per
system; everything keys on physical pages. **Cost/latency**: comparator doubles tokens;
rules-first keeps most free. **Hallucinated dims/quantities**: evidence-quote comparator +
dimension containment. **License**: PyMuPDF AGPL — avoid; pypdf (BSD) split; pdfplumber
(MIT) optional; poppler CLI present. **Determinism**: llama.cpp `cache_prompt` ≠
bit-identical reruns — treat LLM steps as persisted artifacts (pos_NN.csv).

